1
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,447
Hello?

2
00:00:14,793 --> 00:00:15,793
What?

3
00:00:18,808 --> 00:00:19,808
WHAT?!

4
00:00:20,834 --> 00:00:21,834
The fabric?!

5
00:00:22,599 --> 00:00:23,685
Has it been cut already?!

6
00:00:28,121 --> 00:00:29,121
Eunwoo!

7
00:00:29,453 --> 00:00:31,738
Tell the floor manager to
stop the work right now.

8
00:00:32,763 --> 00:00:34,407
I'm heading into the office.

9
00:00:39,662 --> 00:00:41,140
This is insane…

10
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,840
I'm so sorry.

11
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:44,850
Yubin!

12
00:00:47,561 --> 00:00:50,161
Didn't you double check the purchase order
before sending it out?

13
00:00:50,365 --> 00:00:52,282
There's a typo in the fabric name.

14
00:00:52,901 --> 00:00:53,901
I'm sorry.

15
00:00:55,948 --> 00:00:58,269
Even interns don't
make mistakes like this, Yubin.

16
00:01:00,462 --> 00:01:01,462
I'm really sorry.

17
00:01:01,632 --> 00:01:03,072
I'll take responsibility and fix it.

18
00:01:07,418 --> 00:01:09,525
And how exactly are you going to fix it?

19
00:01:15,078 --> 00:01:16,278
Come with me. We need to talk.
